# skills: Feral (Gabryel's own ATK up one stage, no picker). Gabryel alone at level 39 (level index 38 pinned, battle MP pinned to 50), first temple battle.
# On the Special list Right, Right reaches Feral (shot fe_list); A casts at once, with no ally picker:
# the ATK UP banner shows on her (shots fe_a to fe_i), MP 50 -> 42, her ATK stage (record 0 +0x40) goes
# 0 -> 1 and her ATK (+0x24) up by a quarter. Next round A on Feral is refused with "No effect!"
# (fe_refused), the list stays, no MP is taken. Battle records at 0x0228E860 (0x6C each: status in the low nibble of +0x08, HP +0x14, MP +0x18). Run with --save.
include party_gabryel
pin u32 0x020B471C 38
pinptr u32 0x020B8620 0x18 50
wait 270
peek u32 0x020B8620 records
watch u32 0x0228e878 gabryel_mp
watch u16 0x0228e8a0 atk_stage
watch u32 0x0228e884 atk
press A 8
wait 50
press Right 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 60
press Right 8
wait 50
press Right 8
wait 50
shot fe_list
press A 8
wait 30
wait 210
wait 30
shot fe_a
wait 30
shot fe_b
wait 30
shot fe_c
wait 30
shot fe_d
wait 30
shot fe_e
wait 30
shot fe_f
wait 30
shot fe_g
wait 30
shot fe_h
wait 30
shot fe_i
waituntil u32 0x020B0010 7 3000
wait 110
press Right 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 60
press Right 8
wait 50
press Right 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 30
shot fe_refused
wait 100
shot fe_after
